==Battleground==
*5 [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Teacher Bear]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*1 [[Teacher Bear]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (High-Yield)]] spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 33.33~50 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (Low-Yield)]] spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 50~66.67 seconds<sup>1,500f~2,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Pigge]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]]s spawn, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Pigge]]s spawn, delay 30~60 seconds<sup>900f~1,800f</sup>.
**3 [[Festive Otter]]s spawn, delay 25 seconds<sup>750f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Simple meatshielding with your long ranged attackers is enough. You may use [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|Anti-Red]] cats (e.g. [[Axe Cat (Normal Cat)|Axe Cat]] or [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Fish Cat]]) to deal with St. Pigge the 2nd if you like.

